@subsubsection Proppatch

Provided by the module @code{(calp webdav proppatch)}.

@defun exec-propertyupdate body resource
Parses and executes a @code{DAV:propertyupdate} xml element, on behalf
of a PROPPATCH request.

Actual modifications are dispatched through @code{set-property!!} and
@code{remove-property!!}.

A list of propstat objects detailing execution the execution result
are returned.
@end defun
